  "id": "red-riding-hoods",
  "title": "Red Riding Hoods",
  "subtitle": "Four women. A supernatural road trip across America. A found family built on the road.",
  "description": "Red Riding Hoods is a supernatural horror podcast and found-family audio drama — ten episodes following four diverse women on a road trip across America, hunting the demons that the rest of the world refuses to believe in. Elisa de Silva never asked to be chosen. One night in Arizona, she witnessed something impossible — a supernatural killing — and stumbled into four strangers who have been fighting these things for years. Now she is one of them. Together, Elisa, Rosie, Kayla, and Jackie drive the back roads of America, following the trail of supernatural killers from Texas to Louisiana to Massachusetts to Salem, guided by a mysterious woman they know only as Mother. A road trip. A found family. A war nobody else knows is happening. For fans of found family fiction, supernatural action, and strong female leads. If Fourth Wing, Crescent City, Supernatural, Buffy the Vampire Slayer, and Skulduggery Pleasant all live in your heart — this is the audio drama for you. Starring Hailey Pullos (General Hospital), Carolyn Hennesy (True Blood, Cougar Town), Isha Blaaker (The Flight Attendant), Brad Hawkins (Boyhood), and Eric Martsolf (Days of Our Lives). Directed by Sarah Joy Brown. Original score by MikelParis (O.A.R.). Written by David Michael Quiroz Jr. Executive produced by Cassie Jozefov. A Violet Hour Media production. LISTENER WARNING: This program includes depictions of violence and other subject matter that may be upsetting for some listeners. Popular Topics Include: supernatural horror podcast, found family podcast, found family audio drama, supernatural road trip, female-led horror podcast, demon hunter podcast, women who hunt monsters, horror podcast for Fourth Wing fans, horror podcast for Crescent City fans, supernatural podcast like Buffy the Vampire Slayer, supernatural podcast like Supernatural, dark fantasy audio drama, romantasy adjacent podcast, chosen ones horror, horror fiction podcast, scripted horror podcast, audio drama, Hailey Pullos, Carolyn Hennesy, Isha Blaaker, MikelParis, Violet Hour Media, strong female leads horror, road trip horror, occult thriller podcast.",
